  "synopsis": "Mameshiba are mysterious creatures that are not quite beans nor Shiba dogs, but something in between. Each character sports a different piece of trivia. The characters in Oyatsushiba are in the shape of snacks, and each will similarly feature their own trivia in this \"bean trivia x sweet comedy.\"\n\n(Source: ANN)",
  "synopsis_es": "Los mameshiba son criaturas misteriosas que no son exactamente frijoles ni perros Shiba, sino algo intermedio. Cada personaje luce una trivia diferente. Los personajes de Oyatsushiba tienen forma de bocadillos y cada uno presentará de manera similar sus propias trivia en esta \"trivia de frijoles x dulce comedia\".\n\n(Fuente: ANN)",
